            "review_title": "Review at Hủ tiếu hải sản Chang Chang",
            "review_text": "Thuỳ Trang N\n11 contributions\n0\nThe restaurant impressed me\nJul 2023 • Family\nI'm from SG, I often travel in the summer or Tet. I like Nha Trang. Through google maps, I learned about this Chang Chang Seafood Noodles restaurant. What impresses me is that the shop is very clean, including the toilet; Airy, spacious, especially the flavor of the noodles is very delicious, the broth is light and contains no MSG because my friend is allergic to MSG and knows immediately when he eats it. I visited the restaurant 3 times and the restaurant always maintained good quality. The shop is comfortable to sit in because of the beautiful space, free tea and cold towels are another plus. I believe the restaurant will soon become a restaurant loved by tourists, including me\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten August 2, 2023",
